		"description": {
			"public": "<p><strong>Gadget</strong> &middot; <em>Engineer invention powered by Toolbelt scraps. Activate for 1 scrap; spend a 2nd scrap for the Toolbelt effect. Only Engineers gain the active benefit &mdash; an ally given this gadget gains only the Passive.</em></p><hr><p><strong>Free Reaction (1 scrap):</strong> When you Defend, a Melee attacker takes STRd8 Force damage.</p><p><strong>Toolbelt (2 scraps):</strong> A Huge or smaller attacker is pushed away STR spaces.</p><p><strong>Passive:</strong> +1 Armor.</p><hr><p><em>[A] Using the gadget spends 1 Toolbelt scrap — tracked on the sheet (click the counter to correct mistakes).</em></p><p><em>[A] Rolls STRd8 Force against the melee attacker.</em></p><p><em>[A] The Toolbelt upgrade is the separate \"Repulsion Armor (Toolbelt)\" feature (2 scraps total); the passive lives on the \"Repulsion Armor\" gadget feature, so it works even if this item is unequipped.</em></p><p><em>[A] Keep the gadget equipped: Nimble switches off an unequipped object's rules, so its scrap cost would not be charged.</em></p>",
